  "source": "# 00000001158\n\n**English.** Definition: The stable commutator length scl is the optimal norm of commutators. Conjecture: The scl of a lattice is bounded if and only if its rank is one; and the exception to the scl-rank correspondence is the knot-complement group. (scl rank correspondence boundedness)\n\n**中文。** 定义：稳定交换子长度 scl 为换位子的最优范数。猜想：格的 scl 有界当且仅当秩为一；且 scl-秩对应的例外为扭结补群。（scl 秩对应有界）\n",
